PART 2. FONT METRICS COMPILED INTO THE LIBRARY
----------------------------------------------

  fontwidths.go holds advance widths and kerning pairs extracted from
  Liberation Sans and Liberation Serif, release 2.1.5, regular and bold
  (https://github.com/liberationfonts/liberation-fonts). The file is a
  derivative of the Font Software and is distributed under the SIL Open Font
  License 1.1 with the Reserved Font Name "Liberation". No font files are
  included; only the numeric tables.

  Digitized data copyright (c) 2010 Google Corporation with Reserved Font
  Arimo, Tinos and Cousine. Copyright (c) 2012 Red Hat, Inc. with Reserved
  Font Name Liberation.


